# Mobile CI compares this fingerprint to decide whether to compile both native apps. The React Native SDK is
# autolinked from its package root, so Expo hashes the whole package. Its TypeScript and built JavaScript reach the
# app only through the Metro bundle, which the gate's build lane exports for iOS and Android. Its native code,
# podspec, package.json and embedded whiteboard assets stay in the fingerprint.
../../sdks/typescript/react-native/dist/**/*
../../sdks/typescript/react-native/src/**/*
../../sdks/typescript/react-native/test/**/*
../../sdks/typescript/react-native/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
